      "content": "That's a good start for the vibe, but I need them to have actual substance so the audience can follow their logic. \n\nCan you expand on those? I want to hear their actual arguments. For the traditionalist, what is the specific logic they use to justify staying the course? And for the progressive, what are the actual systemic issues they are reacting to? Try to give them both some real intellectual weight.",
